WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.340
Hey youtubers it’s charlie since there’s
been so much news about the flash tv series

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:14.510
I wanted to do a big update on which actors
have been cast, who their characters are and

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.410
how the show is taking a different approach
to the dc universe than Arrow.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:22.240
Also heads up, I’m still collecting questions
for my Arrow Q&amp;A, so feel free to write flash-related

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.410
questions in the comments and I’ll include
a few in that video.

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.179
If you’re finding me for the first time
be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:28.179 --> 00:00:29.480
So let’s start with the cast.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.689
Most everyone is associated with the most
current New 52 versions of the characters.

00:00:32.689 --> 00:00:35.620
Everybody knows about grant gustin playing
barry allen.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:39.420
Unless the arrow writers bring him back for
a cameo in the final episodes of season 2,

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:40.830
he’s still in a coma.

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:45.000
Presumably he would wake up during the flash
pilot and his story would begin by discovering

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.510
how his powers work and his quest to solve
the mystery of his mother’s death.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.740
Those two things will be the biggest stories
during season 1.

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:52.740
On to the main villain.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.440
In a surprising twist, they’re not holding
anything back.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:58.440
They cast Rick Cosnett as Eddie Thawe, also
known as professor zoom or the reverse flash.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:59.890
He’s like the flash’s joker.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:00.890
His greatest enemy.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:03.270
I’m so pumped he’s on the show this soon.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:07.350
The professor zoom character is a huge part
of the flash’s new 52 origin story.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:10.651
I don’t want to spoil what his role in that
is, but you can read all about it in the comics

00:01:10.651 --> 00:01:12.399
starting with The newest version of the flash
comic book.

00:01:12.399 --> 00:01:16.140
On the show, Barry and Eddie will both work
in the Central City police department.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:20.509
The character description makes it sound like
he won’t reveal himself as professor zoom

00:01:20.509 --> 00:01:21.509
right away.

00:01:21.509 --> 00:01:25.060
Then there’s Detective West and his daughter
Iris West.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:29.250
Jesse Martin will play detective west who
will be a mentor to Barry and Iris is played

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.429
by Candice Patton.

00:01:30.429 --> 00:01:32.790
She’ll be barry’s best friend where season
1 picks up.

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:36.509
It’s unclear how of their backstories from
the comics will be in the show.

00:01:36.509 --> 00:01:40.679
They might change a few things because there’s
this big time travel and pre-destination paradox

00:01:40.679 --> 00:01:42.560
aspect to Iris’ character.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.770
Be sure to read the comic if you want to learn
more about it.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:48.639
But let’s just say that every major event
in their lives as well as their existence

00:01:48.639 --> 00:01:53.299
all loops back on itself in this giant mobius
strip of cause and effect with professor zoom

00:01:53.299 --> 00:01:54.310
at the center.

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:58.249
Now is a good time to mention that the show
will be much more hard science-fiction than

00:01:58.249 --> 00:01:59.249
Arrow just because of the time travel aspects
of the story and the speed force.

00:01:59.249 --> 00:02:02.189
So think of it as like a super hero CSI technical
show crossed with arrow.

00:02:02.189 --> 00:02:05.020
The other characters they’ve cast so far
also include Danielle panabaker, she’s one

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.020
of the mid-level villains caitlin snow.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.939
She’s Killer Frost in the comics.

00:02:07.939 --> 00:02:12.720
She’s a STAR Labs bioengineer who’s husband
died in the particle accelerator explosion.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:16.120
I don’t know if they’re going to show
her getting her powers during season 1 or

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:18.439
if she’ll already have them when it starts.

00:02:18.439 --> 00:02:22.530
Carlos Valdes is going to be Cisco Ramon,
the vibe character a lot of you have been

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:23.530
asking me about.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:25.650
He’s like the barry allen of star labs.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:29.620
Really young, really smart and just like Killer
Frost they haven’t said whether or not he’ll

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:33.299
have his powers when the show starts or if
he’ll get them in an ‘accident’.

00:02:33.299 --> 00:02:37.260
They might alter the character a little to
make the particle accelerator explosion the

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.370
source of his powers.

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:42.819
Because in the comics he got them after being
exposed to a boom tube.

00:02:42.819 --> 00:02:46.340
Which is the interdimensional gateway opened
using a mother box.

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:51.079
Which invokes darkside and all this other
crazy DC canon that is way too much for the

00:02:51.079 --> 00:02:52.079
show.

00:02:52.079 --> 00:02:53.079
So bet on them dumbing it down a little.

00:02:53.079 --> 00:02:54.459
Those won’t be the only characters on the
show, but they will be the main characters.

00:02:54.459 --> 00:02:57.569
They’ve already been shooting the pilot
episode and Grant Gustin even tweeted a picture

00:02:57.569 --> 00:02:58.760
of the script.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.849
The series is planned for a Fall 2014 debut,
but nothing has been confirmed.

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:06.430
If they don’t air the pilot this spring
after the arrow season finale then they’ll

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:08.209
at least screen it at comic con.

00:03:08.209 --> 00:03:11.370
Ideally the show will just air back to back
with arrow whenever season 3 starts.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.370
So cross your fingers that the pilot gets
picked up for a full series order and they

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.370
start filming episodes soon.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:16.069
We’ll probably know whether or not that
happens before the end of arrow season 2.

00:03:16.069 --> 00:03:19.780
Now let’s talk some Arrow Crossover, a lot
of you have been asking about Balicity and

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.090
characters going back and forth.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:28.350
So first, Felicity and Barry will still be
a thing.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:34.750
That will be the connective tissue between
shows.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:39.049
There will probably be a minor Felicity cameo,
maybe Oliver.

00:03:39.049 --> 00:03:41.829
For the most part both shows will have separate
storylines.

00:03:41.829 --> 00:03:44.640
But felicity will reference events on the
flash from time to time.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:49.189
The creative force behind both shows is largely
the same, but they’ll have different production

00:03:49.189 --> 00:03:50.670
teams and different writers.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:54.959
Virtually all of the arrow characters and
villains will stay on arrow exclusively, the

00:03:54.959 --> 00:03:59.031
flash show will introduce it’s own villains
including big bad professor zoom and killer

00:03:59.031 --> 00:04:00.031
frost.

00:04:00.031 --> 00:04:03.749
But remember Arrow didn’t go crazy with
super villains in season 1, so expect the

00:04:03.749 --> 00:04:06.280
same thing from the flash.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:08.120
Just with way more science fiction.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:11.160
I hope all that answered most of your bigger
questions about the who and whats of the flash.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:13.900
I’ll be doing video updates for it as new
information comes in, be sure to subscribe

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:17.310
to get everything.

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:24.090
Right now click here for the most recent arrow
video and click here for the q&amp;a video.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:25.890
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:26.400
High Fives!

